###상품 + 이미지
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

실전 멀터 상품
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Multer 다중 이미지 업로드 테스트 상품입니다.
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="price"

1200000
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tags"

["전자제품", "노트북"]
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="test01.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./src/test01.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="test02.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./src/test02.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary--

